 -or-  
 The <see cref="P:System.Data.OleDb.OleDbCommand.Connection" /> is not <see cref="M:System.Data.OleDb.OleDbConnection.Open" />.</exception>
    </member>
    <member name="P:System.Data.IDbCommand.Transaction">
