      <exception cref="T:System.Security.Cryptography.CryptographicException">
              <paramref name="padding" /> does not equal <see cref="P:System.Security.Cryptography.RSASignaturePadding.Pkcs1" /> or <see cref="P:System.Security.Cryptography.RSASignaturePadding.Pss" />. -or-The signature is badly formatted. (In the .NET Framework 4.6 and 4.6.1 only; starting with the .NET Framework 4.6.2, the method returns <see langword="false" /> if a signature is badly formatted.</exception>
    </member>
